/* =====================================================================
 * fanframes.js — the 12-frame fan sprite, base64-embedded.
 *
 * Embedded rather than fetched so the tool works from a double-clicked
 * file:// page, where fetch() of a sibling file is blocked. About 190 kB
 * of source for 140 kB of PNG; the alternative is telling people to
 * download twelve files by hand.
 *
 * Five blades = 72 degrees of rotational symmetry, so 12 frames at 6
 * degrees each loop seamlessly. Rendered from fan-blades.svg.
 * ===================================================================== */
